<title>AUSTRALIA: Queensland appoints new state governor.</title>
<headline>Queensland appoints new state governor.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Queensland premier Rob Borbidge said Peter Arnison had been appointed as the state's new governor and will take up his appointment on July 29.</p>
<p>Arnison, aged 56, a former Australian Army major-general was appointed to replace Leneen Forde who was retiring after five years as the Queen's representative in Queensland.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
